yard load exporter -- accounting notes (rev 6)

Figures are scheduler-confirmed delivery: host_minutes for a shift/class is
the sum, over rostered hosts in load phase that shift, of minutes the class
generator confirmed delivery to the host's pod. Confirmation is per-minute,
deterministic bookkeeping from the generator control loop, not sampled
telemetry. One row per shift per class. Written at shift close by the
exporter on this collector; retained locally for the current intake cycle.
